{"version":1,"key":"card:386","content":{"id":386,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 React 中，经常我们需要监听某个变量的变化，然后触发一个行为，这个时候我们会使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"useEffect","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，将需要被监听的变量放入它的依赖数组，理想情况是在处理函数中你只使用了该变量，因此只需要将该变量放入到依赖数组中即可，但是实际的情况可能是，在处理函数中你使用到了其它状态，这个时候你不得不把其它状态放入到依赖数组中，否则在处理函数中你得到的这个其它状态可能已经过时了，但是你仅仅只想监听那一个状态，这个时候怎么办呢？"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"useEffect(() => {\n  // 只想监听 state1 的变化，但是为了获得最新的 state2，不得不监听 state2\n  onChange(state1, state2);\n}, [state1, state2]);","language":"tsx","uuid":"902006be-7c3e-4616-9bb1-d4e21a63e246","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有没有什么办法，既可以不把依赖的状态声明在依赖数组中，又可以在调用的时候获取到其最终状态呢？官方提出了一个解决方案，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"useEffectEvent","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"你可以将你的处理函数传递给 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"useEffectEvent","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，然后在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"useEffect","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中仅监听你想监听的状态，当状态发生变化时，执行此函数，即使该函数依赖其它状态且你也没有把这些状态放在依赖数组中，你访问到的仍然是最新的状态。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const handler = useEffectEvent((state1) => {\n  onChange(state1, state2);\n});\n\n// 只监听了 state1 的变化，但是在调用 handler 时，仍然可以访问 state2 最新的状态\nuseEffect(() => {\n  handler(state1);\n}, [state1]);","language":"tsx","uuid":"b4ca5c92-e0f7-48c7-a5ab-569f60c92271","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"虽然 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"useEffectEvent","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 存在种种限制，比如只能在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"useEffect","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中调用，但即使这样也能解决很多的问题，不幸的是，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"useEffectEvent","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个 API 是一个实验性的 API，还没有正式被发布。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"好消息是，有替代品，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"ahooks","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"useMemoizedFn","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它的作用类似于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"useCallback","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，可以返回一个引用不变的函数，不同的是，它不用声明依赖数组，但是每次调用时访问到的状态都是最新的，所以上面的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"useEffectEvent","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 完美可以被 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"useMemoizedFn","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 平替"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"// handler 在组件更新的过程中引用始终不变\n// 但是可以访问最新的状态\nconst handler = useMemoizedFn((state1) => {\n  onChange(state1, state2);\n});\n\nuseEffect(() => {\n  handler(state1);\n}, [state1, handler]);","language":"tsx","uuid":"18b829dc-d170-4de7-b5c1-f34d74b00599","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"useMemorizedFn","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的实现非常简单，使用了两个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"ref","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，一个用来维护传入函数的引用，保证调用时能访问到最新的状态，一个用来返回，保证返回的函数引用始终是唯一的"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const useMemorizedFn = (fn) => {\n  const fnRef = useRef();\n  \n  // 传入的 fn 更新时，将其记录在 fnRef 中\n  // 此处 useMemo 不是必须的，因为每次组件更新时 fn 都会更新，这么写没意义\n  // 但是不这么写，在 Redux Dev Tools 有 bug\n  fnRef.current = useMemo(() => fn, [fn]);\n  \n  // 返回的函数的引用\n  const memorizedFn = useRef();\n  // 保证返回的函数的引用始终是唯一的\n  if (!memorizedFn.current) {\n    memorizedFn.current = function(...args) {\n      // 每次调用时访问的都是最新的 fn，因此可以访问到最新的状态\n      return fnRef.current.apply(this, args);\n    }\n  }\n  \n  return memorizedFn.current;\n}","language":"tsx","uuid":"f63bdbdc-84f4-4304-b254-e9ab3c601d8b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://react.dev/learn/separating-events-from-effects","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Separating Events from Effects"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://ahooks.js.org/hooks/use-memoized-fn","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"useMemoizedFn文档"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://github.com/alibaba/hooks/blob/master/packages/hooks/src/useMemoizedFn/index.ts","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"useMemoizedFn 源码"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}],"tags":["React/useEffect","React/技巧","技巧/React","React/useEffectEvent"],"createTime":1702291742614,"updateTime":1762478138953,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1762478138953}}